# Towers (domains/recreation/towers_server): the AGENT mode's envelope for the Towers field, on
# top of t1s.parm. The field is a circle 420 m round SITL's home; the fence is a little wider. The
# drones circle the towers between 40 m and 60 m, under the tower circles' 120 m.
AGENT_FENCE_N 0
AGENT_FENCE_E 0
AGENT_FENCE_R 440
AGENT_CEIL 100
